 "description": "Surface the DN-01..08 denoise stages (commit be9970f) as two\nDetail-tab sliders and thread the values through every render path.\n\nJNI: both floats join the flat grade params of all four entry points\n(nativePreviewRender, nativePreviewSessionRenderCached,\nnativeExportFrame, nativeEncodedDevelop + their jni* wrappers).\nPosition rule: the preview pair carries them between lutStrength and\nmaxDim; the export/encoded pair at the tail after lutStrength, matching\ngradeFromKotlin's field order (GradeK = rawedit::Grade field order).\n\nScale: unlike lutStrength (percent / 100 -> 0..1 blend at the Kotlin\nboundary), both denoise controls are UI percents 0..100 that pass\nthrough at rawedit's native 0..100 scale; the core clamps [0,100]\nitself. GradeMapping.toNative, NativeMp4Session.renderFrame and\nNativeEncodedDeveloper.develop all pass them unchanged.\n\nPersistence: GradeK gains noiseReduction/chromaD",
